Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Marblehead,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Saturday October 24th is\Nlooking like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.33,0:00:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,a tidy little beach day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Preston Beach is the move,\Nespecially
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.97,0:00:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,from 1:30 PM to 5:30 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunny, around 57 degrees, with\Njust
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.65,0:00:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,a 3 mph breeze, so pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.89,0:00:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,friendly out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Low tide is 4:30 PM, great
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,for a low-tide walk and tide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,pools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,High tides are 10:17 AM and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,10:42 PM, with the other low
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,at 4:02 AM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.43,0:00:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pack a layer, but yeah, this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,one’s got some sparkle.
